{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/857756-humanity-question","id":857756,"title":"Humanity question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-04-02T09:45:30-07:00","id":857756,"title":"Humanity question","content":"Hi. I searched the forum but could not find a clear answer. I am not sure about humanity detachment rolls and touchstones.<br /> <br /> From what i understand when a character face a braking point they have to roll that breaking point dice. Do they add +2 from touchstone only on humanity rolls where touchstone is attached or all humanity rolls?<br /> <br /> I post an example so people will understand what i mean.<br /> <br /> Let's say we have vampire named Bob.<br /> <br /> Bob has 6 humanity and touchstone attached to 6 dot. Bob is facing braking point on humanity 5 so that's 3 dice.<br /> <br /> 1. He roll 3 dice only because his touchstone is attached to 6 dot<br /> 2. He roll 5 dice because he has attached touchstone<br /> <br /> Which one of these are true?<br /> <br /> So to sumarrize. Do you add +2 bonus to all braking point's or only those where you have a touchstone attached?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11563-felis-ex-machina","name":"Felis ex machina","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-02T09:55:58-07:00","id":857762,"title":"","content":"If one is attached <i>at all</i>, you add +2.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2698-the-storyteller","name":"The Storyteller","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-02T09:56:05-07:00","id":857763,"title":"","content":"Hi! To all <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> 5 dice on the example<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-02T10:11:19-07:00","id":857769,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Felis ex machina</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/857756-humanity-question#post857756\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hi. I searched the forum but could not find a clear answer. I am not sure about humanity detachment rolls and touchstones.<br /> <br /> From what i understand when a character face a braking point they have to roll that breaking point dice. Do they add +2 from touchstone only on humanity rolls where touchstone is attached or all humanity rolls?</div> </div> </div> </div>They add the +2 to all Humanity rolls.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Felis ex machina</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/857756-humanity-question#post857756\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I post an example so people will understand what i mean.<br /> <br /> Let's say we have vampire named Bob.<br /> <br /> Bob has 6 humanity and touchstone attached to 6 dot. Bob is facing braking point on humanity 5 so that's 3 dice.<br /> <br /> 1. He roll 3 dice only because his touchstone is attached to 6 dot<br /> 2. He roll 5 dice because he has attached touchstone<br /> <br /> Which one of these are true?</div> </div> </div> </div>2. Is true, he would roll 5 dice because he has an attached Touchstone.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Felis ex machina</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/857756-humanity-question#post857756\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So to sumarrize. Do you add +2 bonus to all braking point's or only those where you have a touchstone attached?</div> </div> </div> </div>You add the +2 bonus to all Breaking Points, as long as the Touchstone is attached to yor current Humanity level or lower.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-02T11:51:15-07:00","id":857833,"title":"","content":"Thank you all. Looks like we were playing it wrong then. Also how many times in your games characters have a breaking point?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11563-felis-ex-machina","name":"Felis ex machina","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-02T13:24:12-07:00","id":857885,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Felis ex machina</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/857756-humanity-question?p=857833#post857833\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thank you all. Looks like we were playing it wrong then. Also how many times in your games characters have a breaking point?</div> </div> </div> </div>It's going to different dramatically from group to group based on player behavior and the current Humanity levels (for example, you're going to have way fewer breaking points when you're already at Humanity 3 just because there's so little that still triggers them).<br /> <br /> For what it's worth, my current game has gone 12 sessions with 3-5 PCs each session, and there have been 9 total breaking point rolls over the course of the game. Of course, 4 of them were two sessions ago following a fight, and 2 more were last session as people fed to recover.<br /> <br /> Of the 9, 1 was for killing someone while hunger frenzying, 5 have been for impassioned violence, and the other 3 were for hurting someone over blood.<br /> <br /> Nobody has lost any humanity. Every roll was successful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2698,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2698-the-storyteller","user":"The Storyteller","date":".  bad math 04-02-2016, 08:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2698-the-storyteller","name":"The Storyteller","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-02T14:57:44-07:00","id":857945,"title":"","content":"It all depends on your group. More violent groups are going to hit more breaking points. Surviving something that would hospitalize a human often gets overlooked ( from my experience ) I would say in my groups at least 1 a session","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2308-vitalis","name":"Vitalis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"914"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-02T15:03:58-07:00","id":857954,"title":"","content":"Maybe about once every other session? It's been a while. The lowest a member of the group got was down to 2, and they bought back up to 4 over time.<br /> <br /> Thinking about it we often had them in sort of spurts. Twice every other session would sound more likely. Usually someone does something, frenzies, and does something else they regret, then overreacts to that so you have multiple breaking points.<br /> <br /> I love my group. They couldn't get a hint if you sent them to Hints'r'us with a gift card and a coupon for a free hint with any purchase, but they certainly grasp what it's like to be a monster.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 04-02-2016, 06:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}